WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:06.206
&gt;&gt;&gt; NOW TO A CNN EXCLUSIVE.
U.S. CAPITOL POLICE CHIEF TOM

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:09.843
MANGER IS SPEAKING OUT FOR THE
FIRST TIME SINCE PAUL PELOSI

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:16.449
WAS ATTACKED IN THE WAKE OF THAT
DAY HE IS PAINTING A GRIM

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.784
PICTURE.
HOW WOULD YOU DESCRIBE THE

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:20.887
THREAT LANDSCAPE RIGHT NOW
AGAINST LAWMAKERS?

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:26.459
&gt;&gt; IT'S PROBABLY AS BAD AS
PERHAPS IT'S EVER BEEN AND

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:31.231
CERTAINLY SINCE I'VE BEEN HERE
I'VE SEEN THE THREAT LANDSCAPE

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:36.436
GET MORE AND MORE SERIOUS IN
TERMS OF THE NUMBERS OF THREATS

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.772
AGAINST MEMBERS AND THE TYPES OF
THREATS, EVEN JUST THE THINGS

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:43.243
THAT MEMBERS ARE DEALING WITH
WHEN THEY'RE HERE, HAD THEY'RE

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:48.815
AT THEIR HOME DISTRICTS, SOME OF
THE THREATS THAT THEY GET, SO

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:53.887
JUST THE LEVEL OF HATE SPEECH,
THE LEVEL OF VIOLENCE IN OUR

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.757
COUNTRY DIRECTED TOWARD
POLITICAL OFFICIALS, GOVERNMENT

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:01.895
OFFICIALS, IT'S REALLY AT A
POINT WHERE I THINK THAT IT'S AS

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:06.065
DANGEROUS AS IT'S EVER BEEN TO
BE AN ELECTED OFFICIAL.

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:07.767
&gt;&gt; DANGEROUS AS IT HAS EVER
BEEN.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:11.671
THAT'S PRETTY ALARMING, ALEX.
&gt;&gt; IT SURE IS AND ALL THE MORE

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.674
ALARMING BECAUSE IT'S NOT
TERRIBLY SURPRISING, RIGHT?

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:18.545
WE'VE HEARD IT FROM MEMBERS AND
CANDIDATES THAT THE WAY THEIR

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:21.814
FAMILIES FEEL UNDER SIEGE, THE
THREATS THAT COME IN TO THEIR

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:27.720
YOUNG STAFF, JUST ABUSE POURING
IN OVER THE PHONE LINES WHEN

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:34.160
FEATURED ON TELEVISION PROGRAMS
OR A TARGET OF SOCIAL MEDIA

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.964
MEMBERS OF THE 1/6 COMMITTEE
THAT NEEDED POLICE STATIONED AT

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:41.334
THE END OF THEIR DRIVEWAY.
IT'S INCREDIBLY DARK AND, PAM,

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.570
YOU KNOW, THE THING I FIND MOST
DISQUIETING ABOUT THE WHOLE

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:48.274
THING, THERE'S NO REAL END IN
SIGHT, ALL RIGHT, THAT CHIEF

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.511
MAKER CAN TALK ABOUT WHAT THE
OPTIONS ARE FOR SORT OF BEEFING

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:55.215
SECURITY AT THE CAPITOL OR
RESPONDING MORE ASSERTIVELY TO

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.083
INDIVIDUAL THREATS AGAINST
INDIVIDUAL MEMBERS BUT WE'RE

00:01:57.083 --> 00:02:02.355
LOOKING AT A BIGGER CULTURAL
PROBLEM NOT WITHIN THE POWER OF

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.958
THE CAPITOL POLICE TO SOLVE.
&gt;&gt; SOMETIMES MEMBERS ARE MAKING

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.326
THE PROBLEM WORSE.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, EXACTLY.

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:10.329
THIS IS REALLY THE
RESPONSIBILITY SOMETIMES OF

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:13.800
LAWMAKERS TO BE CAREFUL ABOUT
WHAT THEY'RE SAYING, RIGHT?

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.501
BECAUSE PEOPLE ARE LISTENING TO
THEM.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:19.038
PEOPLE ARE LOOKING UP TO THEM.
PEOPLE TAKE CUES ABOUT PEOPLE

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:21.941
THAT THEY'RE TARGETING.
I THINK THAT THAT IS THE

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:26.045
SCARIEST PART OF THIS IS THAT IF
YOU TELL THE PUBLIC

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:28.815
MISINFORMATION, THEN THE PUBLIC
RECEIVES THAT INFORMATION,

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:31.985
STARTS TO BELIEVE IT AND IT
BECOMES REALLY HARD SOMETIMES TO

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:34.687
UNDO THAT.
I MEAN, I THINK JANUARY 6th IS

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:40.693
REALLY THE PINNACLE EXAMPLE OF
THAT, PEOPLE WERE FED LIES ABOUT

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:44.931
THE ELECTION BEING STOLEN AND IT
FUELED PEOPLE TO WANT TO DO

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.933
SOMETHING ABOUT IT.
PEOPLE WHO WENT INTO THE

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:50.236
BUILDING THAT DAY BELIEVED THAT
THE ELECTION WAS STOLEN.

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.338
&gt;&gt; THERE'S STILL SO MANY
AMERICANS WHO BELIEVE THAT.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.675
I ACTUALLY ASKED CHIEF MANGER
ABOUT JANUARY 6th AND WHETHER HE

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:58.378
HAS THE RESOURCES TO PREVENT
ANOTHER INSURRECTION.

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:01.948
HERE'S WHAT HE SAID.
&gt;&gt; RIGHT AFTER JANUARY 6th,

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:05.184
THERE WERE A FAIR NUMBER OF
AFTER ACTION REPORTS AND

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:10.189
INSPECTOR GENERAL REPORTS THAT
LISTED ALL OF THE THINGS THAT

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:16.429
WENT WRONG, LISTED ALL OF THE
FAILURES THAT PEOPLE DETERMINED

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:20.566
OCCURRED, AND SO IT WAS REALLY A
CHECKLIST THAT WE COULD USE

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:24.470
TO -- AS WE STARTED TRYING TO
PRIORITIZE HOW WE WERE GOING TO

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.973
IMPROVE THINGS, IT WAS A
CHECKLIST THAT WE COULD USE TO

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:32.178
JUST SORT OF KNOCK IT OFF THE
THINGS WE NEEDED TO DO TO ENSURE

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:35.081
THAT JANUARY 6th NEVER HAPPENED
AGAIN.

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:36.849
&gt;&gt; SO CLEARLY CHANGES HAVE BEEN
MADE.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:40.353
THEY WENT THROUGH THAT CHECKLIST
BUT ONLY HAVE SO MANY RESOURCES

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:43.556
AND THAT HAS ALWAYS BEEN A THEME
COMING FROM CAPITOL POLICE.

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:47.093
MONEY IN THE OMNIBUS FOR THEM
BUT HE TALKED ABOUT, LOOK, IN

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:50.530
SOME CASES THEY'VE HAD TO
OUTSOURCE AND PUT 40 TO 50

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.567
OUTSIDE UNARMED GUARDS AT
SECONDARY POINTS OF THE CAPITOL

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:57.603
TO CHECK CREDENTIALS OF PEOPLE
ALREADY IN SO THAT THEY CAN MOVE

00:03:57.603 --> 00:03:59.538
THE OFFICERS ELSEWHERE TO SECURE
IT.

00:03:59.538 --> 00:04:02.775
&gt;&gt; I WAS STRUCK BY HOW THINLY
STRETCHED THEY'VE BEEN SINCE

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:07.413
JANUARY 6th AND FOR THOSE OF US
WHO GO IN AND OUT OF THE CAPITOL

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:11.651
I HAD NO IDEA THOSE FOLKS WHO
WERE MANNING THE DOORS NOW WERE

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:15.755
NOT SECURITY GUARDS AT THIS
POINT AND HE ALSO MENTIONED, I

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:18.290
THINK THIS IS REALLY IMPORTANT,
THEY HAD TO PUT SO MUCH

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:21.394
ATTENTION ON THAT JANUARY 6th
CHECKLIST ON PROTECTING MEMBERS

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:24.530
THERE THAT THAT'S PARTLY HOW
THEY GOT INTO A SITUATION WHERE

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.266
THEY WEREN'T PAYING AS MUCH
ATTENTION TO GUARDING THEIR

00:04:27.266 --> 00:04:30.102
HOMES, GUARDING THEM WHEN
THEY'RE TRAVELING AND THAT

00:04:30.102 --> 00:04:33.139
OBVIOUSLY CAME INTO PLAY WITH
THE SITUATION WITH HOUSE SPEAKER

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:34.240
NANCY PELOSI.
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:38.043
I THINK IN MANY WAYS, YOU KNOW,
YOU COULD SAY IT WAS A WAKE-UP

00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:41.080
CALL BECAUSE THEY HAD BEEN SO
FOCUSED ON PROTECTING THE

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:45.251
PERIMETER THAT YOU HAVE A
SITUATION WHERE ACCORDING TO A

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:51.524
LETTER FROM A HOUSE COMMITTEE
AND CHIEF MAJOR CONFIRMED THEY

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:56.429
HPTSDZ DONE AN ASSESSMENT OF
SPEAKER PELOSI'S RESIDENCE SINCE

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:58.631
SHE BECAME SPEAKER A SECOND
TIME.

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:01.801
THAT SAYS A LOT ABOUT HOW
ESSENTIALLY BOGGED DOWN THEY

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.770
WERE.
WE DON'T KNOW IN 2018 WHAT THEY

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:08.007
OFFERED IN TERMS OF SECURITY
OPTIONS, WHAT THEY SHOULD DO,

00:05:08.007 --> 00:05:09.575
WHETHER THOSE OPTIONS WERE
APPROVED.

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.978
THERE'S STILL A LOT WE DON'T
KNOW BUT IT IS TELLING?

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:15.681
&gt;&gt; IT CERTAINLY IS.
AND THE FACT THAT WE EVEN HAVE

00:05:15.681 --> 00:05:18.818
TO HAVE THIS CONVERSATION ABOUT
HOW STRETCHED THIN THE CAPITOL

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:21.587
POLICE FORCE IS.
IF WE INCREASE THE SIZE OF THE

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:24.390
FORCE BY FIVE OR SIX TIMES,
SURE, THE CAPITOL WOULD BE

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.593
SAFER, THE MEMBERS WOULD BE
SAFER DAY TO DAY BUT THEN WHAT

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:30.863
KIND OF CONGRESS WOULD WE HAVE
AND WHAT KIND OF ABILITY FOR

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:33.899
MEMBERS HAVE TO INTERACT WITH
THE PUBLIC OR MEDIA.

00:05:33.899 --> 00:05:36.602
I DON'T THINK ANYBODY AT THIS
TABLE AND ALMOST SERVING ON THE

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:39.972
HILL WANTS TO GO BACK TO THE
DAYS OF THE CAPITOL BEING ARMED

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:42.175
CAMP AS IT WAS IN THE DAYS AFTER
JANUARY 6th.

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:46.179
BUT, YOU KNOW, GOD, IF THERE'S
NOT SOME KIND OF BIGGER CHANGE

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:50.183
IN THE WAY OUR CULTURE INTERACTS
WITH OUR POLITICS, THAT MAY JUST

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:53.019
BE WHERE WE END UP HEADED.
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY.

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:56.456
AND, YOU KNOW, I ASKED HIM ABOUT
WHAT KEVIN McCARTHY HAS SAID

00:05:56.456 --> 00:05:59.625
THAT, LOOK, THIS IS ABOUT
MANAGEMENT, NOT ADDING MORE

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.662
PEOPLE.
HE'S INDICATED HE WANTS THE

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:05.231
MAGNETOMETERS TO BE TAKEN DOWN
THAT WERE PUT UP.

00:06:05.231 --> 00:06:08.000
THEY PUT IT UP.
THEY CAN TAKE IT DOWN, CHIEF

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.336
MANGER SAID.
A LOT OF PEOPLE HAVE ADVICE ON

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:13.272
HOW TO DO MY JOB.
HE'S IN NO EASY POSITION.

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:16.275
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU THINK ABOUT THE FACT
THAT THESE MEMBERS ARE AT THE

00:06:16.275 --> 00:06:18.310
CAPITOL MAYBE MONDAY THROUGH
THURSDAY OR MONDAY THROUGH

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:21.681
FRIDAY, BUT THEN THEY GO HOME
AND PROTECTING SOMEONE IN THEIR

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:27.586
DISTRICT IS A WHOLE OTHER
CHALLENGE THAT IS I DO NOT ENVY

00:06:27.586 --> 00:06:29.755
HIM FOR HAVING TO FIGURE OUT.
&gt;&gt; HE COULDN'T GET INTO

00:06:29.755 --> 00:06:32.725
SPECIFICS BUT IT'S CLEAR THEY'RE
LOOKING HARD ON HOW TO BEEF UP

00:06:32.725 --> 00:06:35.061
SECURITY FOR MEMBERS WHEN
THEY'RE IN WASHINGTON BUT ALSO

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:38.464
THE RESIDENCES AND FAMILY
MEMBERS IN THE RESIDENCES WHEN

00:06:38.464 --> 00:06:41.434
